              "id": "CVE-2022-29546",
              "name": "LanguageSpecificPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "OutOfMemory Exception by specifically crafted processing instruction in NekoHtml Parser"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "HtmlUnit NekoHtml Parser before 2.61.0 suffers from a denial of service vulnerability. Crafted input associated with the parsing of Processing Instruction (PI) data leads to heap memory consumption. This is similar to CVE-2022-28366 but affects a much later version of the product."
              },
